  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tAccounts Production\n\t\tAccounts Production FAQs\n\n### Directors cessation date is not showing in company information or directors report. How can we correct this?\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Thu, 26 Jun, 2025 at  4:07 PM\n\n\t\tWelcome to this quick guide on how to show the directors cessation date on the directors report. This guide will walk you through the essential steps.\n\nAccounts Production: Company Contacts \n\nNavigation: Accounts production > Client Specific > Settings > Report Settings > Company Directors \n\nFirst you will need to add in the director cessation date. To do this click on the blue icon shown in the picture below. \n\nThis will now open up a new tab shown below, you can now enter the date ceased for this specific director. \n\nClick 'Save' to save the changes.  \n\nAccounts Production: Annual Accounts\n\nNavigation: Accounts production > Client Specific >Reports > Annual Accounts/Management Accounts  > Directors Report\n\nAfter you added the directors cessation date you can create your annual accounts/management accounts, in this you will see the directors cessation date next to that specific director. \n\nAccounts Production: Company Info\n\nNavigation: Accounts production > Client Specific > Settings > Report Settings > Company Info\n\nIf you want to show resigned directors, in your annual accounts/management accounts, click on 'Show resigned directors'. \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115345\">Accounts Production</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188543\">Accounts Production FAQs</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">Directors cessation date is not showing in company information or directors report. How can we correct this?\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Thu, 26 Jun, 2025 at  4:07 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Welcome to this quick guide on how to show the directors cessation date on the directors report. This guide will walk you through the essential steps.</span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><u dir=\"ltr\">Accounts Production: Company Contacts&nbsp;</u></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Navigation:&nbsp;</strong>Accounts production &gt; Client Specific &gt; Settings &gt; Report Settings &gt; Company Directors&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">First you will need to add in the director cessation date. To do this click on the blue icon shown in the picture below.&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9233159741/original/gmISAsG3PukjLILfT_1oFbM8SfdvumVUkA.png?1750761728\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"9233159741\"></span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">This will now open up a new tab shown below, you can now enter the date ceased for this specific director.&nbsp;</span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Click 'Save' to save the changes. &nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9233159754/original/BCoJO1_S03ytShfXqMAvvCoTddG3UDQ84w.png?1750761747\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"9233159754\"></span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><u dir=\"ltr\">Accounts Production: Annual Accounts</u></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Navigation:&nbsp;</strong>Accounts production &gt; Client Specific &gt;Reports &gt; A<span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\">nnual Accounts/Management Accounts</span>&nbsp; &gt; Directors Report</span></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">After you added the directors cessation date you can create your <span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\">annual accounts/management accounts</span>, in this you will see the directors cessation date next to that specific director.&nbsp;<br><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9233161904/original/GeDkFqPTYbwxieubwY9LYnNfnKTcbOfk3w.png?1750764510\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"9233161